cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaLuck: Risk Measurement and Performance Benchmarks in a Live LLM Trading Competition"
abstract: >-
  Six standalone Quantlets reproducing descriptive risk profiles, risk-return
  associations, accounting attribution, paired denominator sensitivities,
  conditional frozen-position stress calculations and the formation-hour and
  margin-policy sensitivity of the frozen-position comparison from minimal
  derived inputs.
  This package does not rebuild the original transaction ledger. The short
  unreplicated design does not establish persistent model skill; frozen-book
  feasibility depends on an unspecified margin policy.
type: software
